                <pb facs="0009" n="1" xml:id="pg1"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">UNITED STATES vs. MEXICO.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">REPORT OF JACKSON H. RALSTON, AGENT OF THE UNITED STATES AND
                    OF COUNSEL,</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">in the matter of the case of
                        the</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">PIOUS FUND OF THE CALIFORNIAS,</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">heard before</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">A TRIBUNAL OF THE PERMANENT COURT of ARBITRATION UNDER THE
                    HAGUE CONVENTION OF 1899, SITTING AT THE HAGUE SEPTEMBER 15, 1902, TO OCTOBER
                    14, 1902, WITH PLEADINGS, APPENDIX, EXHIBITS, BRIEFS, AND RECORD OF THE ENTIRE
                    PROCEEDINGS.</p>
            </div>
